# ── JARVIS — what never belongs in the repository ─────────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run, or is private to the
# developer's machine. A fresh clone with none of it present boots straight to the
# setup screen — the intended first experience — so nothing here needs committing,
# and much of it must NEVER be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
# NOTE: git does not allow a trailing comment on a pattern line ("pola  # comment"
# would be read as a literal pattern). Keep comments on their own line.
# your Gemini API key, plus per-plugin credentials (and their .bak copies)
config/api_keys.json
config/api_keys.json.bak
# the dashboard's TLS private key and certificate
config/certs/
# a LINKED WhatsApp session — committing it hands somebody your WhatsApp account
config/whatsapp_web/
# cloud link: private key + link record
cloud_state/
*.pem
*.key
# Google OAuth tokens (Gmail / Calendar plugins)
**/token*.json
# Google OAuth client secrets
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
# Long-term memory, semantic recall, audit trail, calendars, trusted-tool state,
# recent files, macros, vision watchers, reminders, and every backup of them.
memory/long_term.json
memory/long_term.json.bak
memory/*.bak
memory/*.bak-*
memory/semantic.jsonl
memory/audit.jsonl
memory/calendar_cache.ics
memory/calendar_state.json
memory/jobs_state.json
memory/tool_trust.json
memory/recent_files.json
memory/macros.json
memory/vision_watchers.json
memory/water_state.json
memory/sent_recipients.json
memory/workspace.json
memory/*.db
# secondary local assistant store
.workbuddy-ai/

# ── Internal developer notes & audit reports (not for a public portfolio) ─────
AUDIT-KRITIS-*.md
TRAINER-REPORT-*.md
_audit_tmp/
_archive/
_final.png
_hud_grad.png
# _refwork is developer scratch (screenshots, probes, trainer/bisect scripts).
# Keep ONLY the sonde_*.py probes that run_tests.py actually executes.
_refwork/*
!_refwork/sonde_*.py

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ── Virtual environments (covers .venv, .venv313, venv, env, ...) ─────────────
.venv*/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/
